    phrases: [
      "\"Fold. This doesn't clear the safety factor.\"",
      "\"I don't build to spec minimum. I don't play to pot odds minimum either.\"",
      "\"That's an unmodeled load. I'm out.\"",
      "\"I need this to survive being wrong twice, not just once.\"",
      "\"You're all playing this like nothing unexpected ever happens. Something always happens eventually.\"",
      "\"I watched a business fold in eighteen months from one bad month. I remember the shape of it.\"",
      "\"Call. Every margin cleared.\"",
      "\"I'm not folding out of fear. I'm folding because the structure doesn't hold.\"",
      "\"Small bet. I don't over-load anything I don't have to.\"",
      "\"This hand only wins in the scenario where nothing goes wrong. That's not a plan.\"",
      "\"I recount because the first count is never the one I trust.\"",
      "\"That's fatigue stress, not a bad beat. It adds up whether you notice it or not.\"",
      "\"I don't chase a correction. I just build the next thing stronger.\"",
      "\"You want me to gamble on a coin flip. I don't do coin flips.\"",
      "\"This is the one hand tonight rated for full load.\"",
      "\"Quiet. I'm still checking the numbers.\"",
      "\"I'd rather under-build my bet than over-build my regret.\"",
      "\"Every stack has a failure point. I'm not finding mine tonight.\"",
      "\"That raise doesn't change my load calculation.\"",
      "\"I fold the same way a good design fails — safely, and on purpose.\"",
      "\"I'm not tilted. I'm re-checking tolerances.\"",
      "\"You can have this one. I'll take the stack that's still standing.\"",
      "\"My cousin thought their margins would hold too.\"",
      "\"This is the rare case where the numbers actually clear every check I have.\"",
      "\"I don't need the biggest pot. I need the one that doesn't collapse.\"",
      "\"Fold. The load case doesn't check out.\"",
      "\"I'll take the small, certain outcome over the big, uncertain one every time.\"",
      "\"I just lost the lead. Fine — I'll rebuild mine on a stronger foundation.\"",
      "\"That's not bad luck. That's an unmodeled load finally showing up.\"",
      "\"Raise. Every safety check on this hand comes back clean.\"",
      "\"I don't sign off on anything I haven't checked twice.\"",
      "\"This is within tolerance. I'm calling.\"",
      "\"I've watched the worst case happen before. I don't bet like it can't happen again.\"",
      "\"Quiet bet. I never load a structure past what it's rated for.\"",
      "\"I'm not tilted. I'm re-running the numbers with better data.\"",
      "\"This is the one hand tonight rated for full load. I'm going in.\"",
      "\"I don't need the biggest win. I need the one that doesn't fail later.\"",
      "\"Every stack has a failure point, same as every structure. I'm not finding mine on this hand.\"",
      "\"Call. The margin's still there.\"",
      "\"That raise doesn't change what the numbers already told me.\"",
      "\"I lost ground just now. I'll close the gap the way I close every gap — slowly, and correctly.\"",
      "\"I don't build for the average case. I build for the bad one.\"",
      "\"Small bet. I don't overload anything I don't have to.\"",
      "\"This one clears every check I've got. In.\"",
      "\"I fold the way a good design fails — safely, on purpose, and without drama.\"",
      "\"I'd rather be under-committed and right than over-committed and hoping.\"",
      "\"That's fatigue stress. It doesn't show up all at once, and then it does.\"",
      "\"I don't chase a correction. I just build the next hand stronger.\"",
      "\"I'll take the stack that's still standing when it matters most.\"",
      "\"This is the rare hand where nothing about it worries me.\"",
    ],
