      "That's an easy fold once you stop looking at how much you put in already.",
      "I'll match that pot. Still my decision, not the pot's.",
      "Somebody just passed me on the board. Fine. Plenty of hand left.",
      "Good session so far. I'll say the same thing about a bad one later tonight.",
      "I'm calling, mostly to see what you do next.",
      "That beat would've bothered me thirty years ago. It doesn't now.",
      "I fold hands like this all night if I have to. It costs me nothing.",
      "Deal it. I'm not in any rush to see what's coming.",
      "Whatever's next, I'll meet it the same way I met the last one.",
