    phrases: [
      "Okay, okay, I can feel this one before I even look.",
      "Don't talk to me, I'm heating up.",
      "Third one in a row — you know what that means.",
      "I priced this exact spot yesterday for a client, forget the math, I'm in.",
      "Same cap, same seat, don't move my chips.",
      "It's not luck, it's rhythm. Rhythm's a real thing.",
      "I was ice cold for six hands, this is the one, I can feel it turning.",
      "Bump it up — when I'm on, I'm on.",
      "You really want to test me right now? I'm three for three.",
      "Regression to the mean is real, it just doesn't apply tonight.",
      "I've been quiet too long. This is the hand.",
      "Don't reshuffle the deck yet, let me stay hot.",
      "That's back-to-back-to-back, table, take notes.",
      "I had a week like this once. Changed my whole life.",
      "I'm not chasing, I'm collecting what's owed.",
      "Every actuary in America would tell me to fold. I'm not folding.",
      "This seat's cooking. I'm not giving it up.",
      "Cold streak's just a hot streak that hasn't started yet.",
      "I called that card before it flipped, ask anybody.",
      "One more buy-in. It's about to turn, I can feel the seams.",
      "You ever have a night where you just can't miss? This is that.",
      "I'm not superstitious, I just don't touch the stack when it's working.",
      "Three losses back to back means four's coming up green.",
      "Watch, watch, this is exactly the spot I've been running good in.",
      "I'll take the bad beat. Just means the next one's mine.",
      "I'm folding this one — the touch isn't there yet, no sense forcing a bad shot.",
      "Give me a second to shoot free throws in my head before I decide.",
      "I'm laying this hand down. I'd rather wait for a clean look than force one.",
      "Fourth win in a row. At some point you have to just admit I'm shooting lights out.",
      "Somebody take my cap off me if you want, but I'm not taking it off myself.",
      "This is a heat-check raise. I know it. I'm doing it anyway.",
      "I clocked ten in a row before I even left the house tonight, so yeah, I'm confident.",
      "Folding. Even a hot shooter takes a bad look sometimes.",
      "That's the cold streak talking, not the cards — I know the difference, and I'm still in.",
      "I got overtaken there for a second, but that's just a rim I need to find again.",
      "Don't worry about me, I've been in bigger droughts than this and come out shooting.",
      "I ran the numbers on myself once. Don't bring that up right now.",
      "Raise. When the shot's falling you don't stop shooting it.",
      "I'm out on this one. No feel, no forcing it.",
      "That's the kind of hand that gets talked about later. I can already tell.",
      "Somebody just took the lead off me — noted. I'll take it back within the hour.",
      "I'm buying in again. The touch doesn't leave, it just goes quiet for a minute.",
      "Every actuary in the building says I'm due for a cold month. I say watch me.",
      "That's a clean win. Didn't even feel contested.",
      "I'm folding — not every hand's the one, even when you're rolling.",
      "This is exactly the stretch I warm up for. I'm not blinking.",
      "Call it luck if you want, I call it rhythm holding up.",
      "Rough beat, but I've walked out of worse gyms than this one still hot.",
      "I'm raising into this. If I'm wrong I'm wrong loud.",
      "Same cap, same seat, same result coming — watch.",
    ],
