      "Raise into a board that scares nobody — that's the whole appeal.",
      "You caught the tell. Good. Now watch me build a new one in real time.",
      "Declining the buy when everyone expects it — that's the art.",
      "Fold now so the next one lands harder.",
      "I'd rather be the headline than the winner, and I've had both.",
