      "Four hands the same way and the whole table thinks it's got me. Watch.",
      "Fold. Not because it's smart. Because it's the boring answer and I hate those.",
      "Raising with garbage, purely for the look on your face.",
      "That's twice tonight I've contradicted myself on purpose. I'm keeping count even if you're not.",
