      "I'm not hiding the inconsistency. Hiding it would ruin the reveal.",
      "You just described my tendencies out loud. Watch what happens next hand.",
      "Boise's construction rule is a gift — nobody agrees what \"correct\" even is here.",
      "I'll take the worse combination tonight. It's more mine.",
