      "You said what I'd do. I heard you. I'm doing the other thing.",
      "Took the bonus on nothing. Don't bother looking for the logic.",
      "That bad beat is going straight into the next issue, unattributed.",
      "Raising with garbage specifically because the garbage doesn't deserve the fold everyone expects.",
      "You caught the tendency. Good. It's already retired.",
      "Declined the buy when the buy was obvious. That's the entire decision.",
      "Fold now, so the next one has somewhere to land.",
      "I've been three different players tonight and none of them were lying, exactly.",
      "You took my spot — good, there's less to track from back here.",
      "This win doesn't mean anything if you can explain how I got it.",
      "Bought the buy-back nobody needed. Consider it noise, intentionally.",
      "Four hands the same way is a pattern. A pattern is a liability. Killing it now.",
      "Fold. Not because it's wrong. Because it's the answer you already wrote down for me.",
      "Raise, for no reason that will still make sense tomorrow.",
      "That's the second contradiction this hour. I'm not going to explain the first one either.",
